  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.550" end="00:10.710" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe you can't help falling in love with me, right?</p>
      <p begin="00:10.710" end="00:13.990" ttm:agent="v1">지금 네 감정 말 안 해도 알아 다</p>
      <p begin="00:13.990" end="00:17.160" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, I know that you can't get me off your mind</p>
      <p begin="00:17.160" end="00:20.330" ttm:agent="v1">I can read the sign</p>
      <p begin="00:20.330" end="00:23.530" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, 어설프대도 완벽해</p>
      <p begin="00:23.530" end="00:26.750" ttm:agent="v1">I'm lovin' it you, just can't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:26.750" end="00:30.090" ttm:agent="v1">넌 내 세상을 못 벗어나, no way out</p>
      <p begin="00:30.090" end="00:31.950" ttm:agent="v1">No way out</p>
      <p begin="00:31.950" end="00:35.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">On your lips, something sweet (Your lips, something sweet)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.180" end="00:39.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You and I, 느껴봐 이대로 (Oh-ooh-woah, oh-oh, ooh-woah, ooh-woah)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.940" end="00:41.740" ttm:agent="v1">Take my love</p>
      <p begin="00:41.740" end="00:44.990" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, every time you touch me, 짜릿해 and I like it</p>
      <p begin="00:44.990" end="00:48.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The way that you're holding me tight (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="00:48.390" end="00:51.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">나로 가득한 your eyes (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.550" end="00:54.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">내게 푹 빠진 순간 (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.640" end="00:57.910" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you stop, you know I like it</p>
      <p begin="00:57.910" end="01:01.130" ttm:agent="v1">I can feel when you're next to me</p>
      <p begin="01:01.130" end="01:04.360" ttm:agent="v1">느껴 강렬한 energy</p>
      <p begin="01:04.360" end="01:07.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">그게 난 싫지 않아 (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="01:07.560" end="01:10.950" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you stop, you know I like it</p>
      <p begin="01:10.950" end="01:14.300" ttm:agent="v1">Just like a love spеll, 빠져들지</p>
      <p begin="01:14.300" end="01:17.270" ttm:agent="v1">넌 내게 이미 too deep</p>
      <p begin="01:17.270" end="01:20.400" ttm:agent="v1">애타는 네 마음 종일 내 생각 중</p>
      <p begin="01:20.400" end="01:24.490" ttm:agent="v1">모른척한 이유 'cause I know you're so cute, babе</p>
      <p begin="01:24.490" end="01:27.560" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, 네 온 신경을 집중해</p>
      <p begin="01:27.560" end="01:30.780" ttm:agent="v1">또 홀린 듯 날 쫓는 your eyes</p>
      <p begin="01:30.780" end="01:33.970" ttm:agent="v1">이미 나에게 사로잡혀, no way out</p>
      <p begin="01:33.970" end="01:35.920" ttm:agent="v1">No way out</p>
      <p begin="01:35.920" end="01:39.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">On your lips, something sweet (Your lips, something sweet)</p>
      <p begin="01:39.120" end="01:43.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You and I, 즐겨봐 이대로 (Oh-ooh-woah, oh-oh, ooh-woah, ooh-woah)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.870" end="01:45.760" ttm:agent="v1">Take my love</p>
      <p begin="01:45.760" end="01:49.040" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, every time you touch me, 짜릿해 and I like it</p>
      <p begin="01:49.040" end="01:52.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The way that you're holding me tight (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="01:52.360" end="01:55.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">나로 가득한 your eyes (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.610" end="01:58.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">내게 푹 빠진 순간 (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="01:58.860" end="02:01.980" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you stop, you know I like it</p>
      <p begin="02:01.980" end="02:05.060" ttm:agent="v1">I can feel when you're next to me</p>
      <p begin="02:05.060" end="02:08.350" ttm:agent="v1">느껴 강렬한 energy</p>
      <p begin="02:08.350" end="02:11.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">그게 난 싫지 않아 (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:11.530" end="02:17.140" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you stop, you know I like it</p>
      <p begin="02:17.140" end="02:20.300" ttm:agent="v1">커지는 설렘 이 감정을 붙잡아</p>
      <p begin="02:20.300" end="02:23.680" ttm:agent="v1">No way to stop it, baby, when it feels so right</p>
      <p begin="02:23.680" end="02:25.740" ttm:agent="v1">지금 이 느낌 captivatin', can't explain it</p>
      <p begin="02:25.740" end="02:29.290" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause every time you touch, I get a rush and I like it</p>
      <p begin="02:29.290" end="02:32.130" ttm:agent="v1">Every time we touch, I get a rush and I like it, like it</p>
      <p begin="02:32.130" end="02:35.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">The way that you're holding me tight (I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:35.580" end="02:38.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">나로 가득한 your eyes (I like it; I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:38.720" end="02:41.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">내게 푹 빠진 순간 (That's right, I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:41.970" end="02:45.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Don't you stop, you know I like it (I like it, like it, I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:45.060" end="02:48.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I can feel when you're next to me (Ooh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:48.370" end="02:51.520" ttm:agent="v1">느껴 강렬한 energy</p>
      <p begin="02:51.520" end="02:54.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">그게 난 싫지 않아 (I like it, I like it, I like it, I like it, like it)</p>
      <p begin="02:54.750" end="02:57.830" ttm:agent="v1">Don't you stop, you know I like it</p>
